// Names hidden, which kappa folds in privately, by a listed clause read while
// kappa is mid-fold: kappa -> nu -> kappa. It is missing the first time and
// private after; a private binding may yet be made public by another route, so
// the item waits, and is reported once the passes have settled -- as private,
// which is what a single pass would have said.

mod nu;

import kappa use hidden;    //~ ErrorNotPublic:18 "hidden is private to kappa, so it does not fold."
